      "text": "variable      label                type  codes / missing\n\nbreakoff      Result of visit      num   1 Continue interview\n                                         2 Respondent withdrew\n                                         8 DK · 9 Refused\nq18_income    Monthly income (PHP) num   -98 DK · -99 Refused\nfacility_type Facility type        num   1 RHU · 2 Hospital ...\n\n+ universe & skip refs (Skip-Logic docs)\n+ question text from .qsf · F2 from PWA spec\n→ per instrument: xlsx + PDF + data-room CSVs",
