    {
      "type": "text", "id": "c_mock_body", "x": 1136, "y": 420, "width": 450, "height": 240,
      "text": "UHC-Y2 Recode Manual (DHS7-style)\n──────────────────────────────────\nnative (.dcf)            recode\nbreakoff             →   fh107  Result of visit\nq18_income           →   fh018  Monthly income\nq177_..._total_php   →   fh177  Health exp 12m\n\nstandard codes on EVERY variable:\n  8 / 98 / 998 = Don't know\n  9 / 99 / 999 = Missing/Refused\n  96 = Other · 97 = Inconsistent\n\n+ flat recode datasets (FHFL, PTFL ...)\n+ printed Recode Manual (variable map)",
      "originalText": "UHC-Y2 Recode Manual (DHS7-style)\n──────────────────────────────────\nnative (.dcf)            recode\nbreakoff             →   fh107  Result of visit\nq18_income           →   fh018  Monthly income\nq177_..._total_php   →   fh177  Health exp 12m\n\nstandard codes on EVERY variable:\n  8 / 98 / 998 = Don't know\n  9 / 99 / 999 = Missing/Refused\n  96 = Other · 97 = Inconsistent\n\n+ flat recode datasets (FHFL, PTFL ...)\n+ printed Recode Manual (variable map)",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400008, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
